      "figures": [
        {
          "id": "fig-22",
          "label": "图 22",
          "box": [
            1628,
            1851,
            571,
            590
          ]
        }
      ],
      "provenance": {
        "cap": "1",
        "normalized": true
      }
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "10. 二元不等式组"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来讨论二元不等式组：",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交",
        "集."
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上",
        "点的集合是什么."
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位",
        "于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，",
        "这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的",
        "点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个",
        "集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于",
        "由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的",
        "集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只",
        "有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组",
        "（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一",
        "种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区",
        "域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 22",
      "box": [
        1628,
        1851,
        571,
        590
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-22"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 22",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "出半圆."
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们再举两个例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1 不等式组",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\leqslant0,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "53"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
