  "blocks": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "133",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\geqslant0,\\\\↵y&\\leqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\geqslant2,\\\\y&\\leqslant-1;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "в) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2&\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\↵1&\\leqslant y\\leqslant5;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "134",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的",
        "点的集合：",
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\y&\\leqslant-2x+6;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x+2,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\↵y&\\leqslant5;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\leqslant0,\\\\2y-6x+3&\\geqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\leqslant2,\\\\↵y-x&\\leqslant2,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "135",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点",
        "的集合：",
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant0.64,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\geqslant4,\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "в) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant4-x;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x^2,\\\\↵y-4&\\leqslant0.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "136",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集",
        "合，写出这些不等式组."
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
